### Create a new user
POST http://localhost:3000/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "John Doe",
    "email": "jd@jd.com",
    "password": "password123"
}

### Get user by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/users/569a6a5b-b273-49ed-8cb5-0a891f6990ec

### Get user by email
GET http://localhost:3000/users/email/jd@jd.com

### Update user information
PATCH  http://localhost:3000/users/569a6a5b-b273-49ed-8cb5-0a891f6990ec
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "John Doe Updated"
}

### Delete a user
DELETE http://localhost:3000/users/569a6a5b-b273-49ed-8cb5-0a891f6990ec

